      <div className="sidebar-bottom"><div className="research-note"><span className="note-symbol"><ShieldCheck size={19}/></span><strong>Evidence over noise.</strong><p>Real sources. Clear assumptions.<br/>Better-informed research.</p><button onClick={()=>navigate('sources')}>See our methodology <ArrowUpRight size={14}/></button></div><div className="local-profile"><span className="avatar">FW</span><div><strong>Your workspace</strong><span>Saved on this device</span></div><CircleHelp size={16}/></div></div>
